    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Rake the Sands Until They Surface</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;It's been a year since the war ended and Etheria was freed from Horde Prime, and all should be well. But all is not well with Queen Glimmer, her father King Micah, and her friendâ€”and foreign ministerâ€”Catra. In addition to their relationship being strained by grief, Glimmer and Micah find themselves suddenly unable to cast spells. Meanwhile, Glimmer and Catra have to address the uncomfortable facts of their friendship: what happened to Queen Angella, and who was responsible. Between all of them, a shadow still hangs. Can a trip to Mystacor solve all their problems, or will the past always haunt them?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Featuring illustrations by &lt;a href="https://linktr.ee/EmileeDoodles" rel="nofollow"&gt;EmileeDoodles.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
